(6316291, 936118, 112972, '<td valign="top">I have the same exact mask sitting around the house and I photographed it like an hour before the voting began, but changed my mind and went with the street shot challenge.  I don''t know what color this one is but mine is green :)  These maks are tough to photograph without blowing out the parts that the light is hitting them and that is the case here.  Would have liked to see the eyes a tad sharper, but over all a nice shot.  I am giving it a 7.</td>', 'I have the same exact mask sitting around the house and I photographed it like an hour before the voting began, but changed my mind and went with the street shot challenge.  I don''t know what color this one is but mine is green :)  These maks are tough to photograph without blowing out the parts that the light is hitting them and that is the case here.  Would have liked to see the eyes a tad sharper, but over all a nice shot.  I am giving it a 7.', '2011-02-16 02:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
