(6320598, 935331, 103142, '<td valign="top">This one just makes me laugh!! I think the photography could be better. The reflections on the brush are a bit harsh -- could you have diffused the light source a little more? If it was a window, perhaps some sheer fabric or even a sheet? The NG on the computer draws my eyes, I would have been tempted to crop it in a bit. The brush could use a little more head room. And the flash of orange or red down in the right corner is distracting.<br/> <br/>However, that being said -- I don''t think that photography has to be about technically spectacular photos. I like how my eye was initially drawn to the keyboard, and that I had to work my way up to the brush. And what a surprise when I got there! You made a great initial impression with the shot. And I think that''s worth an 8.</td>', 'This one just makes me laugh!! I think the photography could be better. The reflections on the brush are a bit harsh -- could you have diffused the light source a little more? If it was a window, perhaps some sheer fabric or even a sheet? The NG on the computer draws my eyes, I would have been tempted to crop it in a bit. The brush could use a little more head room. And the flash of orange or red down in the right corner is distracting. However, that being said -- I don''t think that photography has to be about technically spectacular photos. I like how my eye was initially drawn to the keyboard, and that I had to work my way up to the brush. And what a surprise when I got there! You made a great initial impression with the shot. And I think that''s worth an 8.', '2011-02-19 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
